{"seq":3,"slug":"policy-version-distribution","title":"策略版本化与下发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-content-compliance-filter/compliance-policy-model/policy-version-distribution","wordCount":3736,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"策略版本化与下发\">策略版本化与下发</h1><p>一条合规规则从「法务确认」到「在全球 2000 个 serving 节点上生效」，中间隔着一次分布式系统的经典问题：如何在不停机、可审计的前提下，让一个不可变的事实（某个时刻的生效策略集合）在所有节点上达成一致。搜索链路的特殊之处在于容忍度极低——过滤策略的生效延迟是合规风险，而策略的错误版本是误杀事故，两个方向都要防。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-策略快照是不可变对象\">核心概念：策略快照是不可变对象</h2><p>把「当前生效的策略」理解为一个可变集合，是几乎所有下架事故的根源：可变集合的每一次增删改都产生一个没有名字的中间态，事故复盘时无法回答「当时生效的是哪一版」。正解是<strong>策略快照（policy snapshot）</strong>——一个不可变、全局唯一、带内容哈希的对象，包含在某个时间窗内对某个作用域生效的全部规则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>snapshot</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mtext>snapshot_id</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>hash</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>scope</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>from</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>to</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{snapshot} = \\langle \\text{snapshot\\_id},\\; \\text{hash},\\; \\{r_1,\\dots,r_n\\},\\; \\text{scope},\\; [t_{\\text{from}}, t_{\\text{to}}) \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">snapshot</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">snapshot_id</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scope</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">from</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">to</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)⟩</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个性质缺一不可：<strong>不可变</strong>意味着任何修改都产生新快照，旧快照永久可查；<strong>可寻址</strong>意味着节点可以按 <code>snapshot_id + hash</code> 拉取并校验内容；<strong>有界</strong>意味着快照有明确的有效时间窗，节点不需要自己判断「现在该用哪一版」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  E[编辑策略] --&gt; V[编译: 谓词 -&gt; 索引结构]&#10;  V --&gt; C[静态校验: 覆盖率/冲突/引用]&#10;  C --&gt;|失败| X[拒绝发布 + 报告]&#10;  C --&gt;|通过| S[生成快照 + 内容哈希]&#10;  S --&gt; ST[签名]&#10;  ST --&gt; R[注册到版本仓库]&#10;  R --&gt; CD[变更分发通道]&#10;  CD --&gt; N1[serving 节点 A]&#10;  CD --&gt; N2[serving 节点 B]&#10;  N1 --&gt; A1[原子切换到新快照]&#10;  N2 --&gt; A1&#10;  A1 --&gt; ACK[上报生效版本与哈希]\">graph TD\n  E[编辑策略] --&gt; V[编译: 谓词 -&gt; 索引结构]\n  V --&gt; C[静态校验: 覆盖率/冲突/引用]\n  C --&gt;|失败| X[拒绝发布 + 报告]\n  C --&gt;|通过| S[生成快照 + 内容哈希]\n  S --&gt; ST[签名]\n  ST --&gt; R[注册到版本仓库]\n  R --&gt; CD[变更分发通道]\n  CD --&gt; N1[serving 节点 A]\n  CD --&gt; N2[serving 节点 B]\n  N1 --&gt; A1[原子切换到新快照]\n  N2 --&gt; A1\n  A1 --&gt; ACK[上报生效版本与哈希]</pre><h3 id=\"为什么编译要与编辑分离\">为什么编译要与编辑分离</h3><p>运营编辑的是自然语言的规则描述与谓词，而 serving 需要的是可高速执行的索引结构——确定性有限自动机（DFA）用于词汇匹配、倒排表用于类目与标签、位图用于受众与渠道。两者之间必须有一道编译边界。</p>\n<p>这道边界的价值不只是性能，它让<strong>静态校验在发布前发生</strong>：编译器可以检查两条规则是否在同一作用域产生互斥动作、引用的类目 ID 与标签是否存在、辖区覆盖率矩阵是否有空格子。这些检查放到运行时，代价是线上事故；放到编译期，代价是一次 CI 失败。</p>\n<p>编译产物的另一个好处是<strong>可确定性验证</strong>：同一个输入策略集合必须产出字节级相同的产物，否则无法用哈希做节点间比对，也无法复现历史判定。因此编译器必须杜绝时间戳、随机数、遍历顺序等非确定性来源——规则排序按稳定键（<code>rule_id</code>），并清洗编辑元数据（<code>created_at</code>、<code>updated_by</code>、注释）：产物里只要含一个随编辑时间变化的字段，同一份语义就会产出两个哈希，节点间比对将不断误报不一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"版本仓库与发布的不可变性\">版本仓库与发布的不可变性</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE policy_snapshots (&#10;  snapshot_id   BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  content_hash  TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;  parent_hash   TEXT,&#10;  scope_id      TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  rule_count    INT  NOT NULL,&#10;  artifact_uri  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  signature     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  format_version INT NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_from TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  published_by  TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  state         TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;STAGED&#39;&#10;                CHECK (state IN (&#39;STAGED&#39;,&#39;CANARY&#39;,&#39;ACTIVE&#39;,&#39;SUPERSEDED&#39;,&#39;ROLLED_BACK&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE snapshot_rollout (&#10;  snapshot_id  BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES policy_snapshots(snapshot_id),&#10;  ring         TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  target_pct   NUMERIC(5,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  activated_at TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (snapshot_id, ring)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> policy_snapshots</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshot_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  content_hash  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  parent_hash   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_count    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  artifact_uri  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  signature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  format_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  published_by  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'STAGED'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'STAGED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CANARY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ACTIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SUPERSEDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ROLLED_BACK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> snapshot_rollout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  snapshot_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> policy_snapshots(snapshot_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ring         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target_pct   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  activated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (snapshot_id, ring)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>parent_hash</code> 是版本谱系的锚，它使「回滚」可以被表达为「把某个历史快照重新置为 ACTIVE」，而不是「写一条反向规则」。这个区别在监管场景下是决定性的：反向规则会在生效记录里留下两条语义冲突的条目，而回滚只留下一条清晰的谱系。<code>state</code> 里的 <code>SUPERSEDED</code> 与 <code>ROLLED_BACK</code> 必须分开——前者是正常的新旧交替，后者是发布事故，后者必须触发复盘。</p>\n<h3 id=\"版本号-签名与增量下发\">版本号、签名与增量下发</h3><p>快照编号与内容哈希是两件事，混为一个字段会在灰度场景下立刻出问题：灰度期间同一个 <code>snapshot_id</code> 的产物在不同圈层可能不同（如果按圈层裁剪规则），而哈希必须唯一标识确切的字节。因此标识分三层：<code>snapshot_id</code> 是单调递增序列，作人类引用与审计锚点；<code>content_hash</code> 是编译产物加元数据的 SHA-256，是节点间一致性比对与验签的对象；<code>ring_artifact</code> 是按圈层裁剪后的产物哈希，只在圈层内比对。签名覆盖 <code>content_hash</code> 与发布元数据，不覆盖规则源码——验证一个节点「执行的东西是否经过审核」只需哈希比对，不需要重跑编译器。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;snapshot_id&quot;: 90412,&#10;  &quot;content_hash&quot;: &quot;sha256:6c1f9a3e...b7d2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;format_version&quot;: 3,&#10;  &quot;effective_from&quot;: &quot;2026-09-27T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;published_by&quot;: &quot;compliance-ops-id&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rollback_target&quot;: 90398,&#10;  &quot;rings&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;ring&quot;: &quot;internal&quot;, &quot;target_pct&quot;: 1.0 },&#10;    { &quot;ring&quot;: &quot;id-id-canary&quot;, &quot;target_pct&quot;: 0.05 }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;signature&quot;: { &quot;alg&quot;: &quot;ed25519&quot;, &quot;key_id&quot;: &quot;policy-signing-2026-Q3&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: &quot;base64:MEUCIQDx...&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"snapshot_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90412</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"content_hash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:6c1f9a3e...b7d2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"format_version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effective_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-27T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"published_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"compliance-ops-id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rollback_target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90398</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ring\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"internal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ring\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"id-id-canary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"target_pct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"signature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"alg\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ed25519\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"key_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"policy-signing-2026-Q3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"base64:MEUCIQDx...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>rollback_target</code> 是发布时就写进元数据的字段，而不是事故现场再去查的：它把「回滚到哪一版」从临场判断变成预先批准的决策——事故现场的时间压力下，人倾向于选择「最近的 ACTIVE」，而那一版可能也有问题。</p>\n<p>全量下发在规则量级增长后变得昂贵，因此需要增量 diff，但 diff 的正确性依赖严格前提：<strong>节点当前的 base 版本必须与 diff 声明的 base 一致</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;diff_id&quot;: &quot;D-90412&quot;,&#10;  &quot;base_snapshot_id&quot;: 90398,&#10;  &quot;base_hash&quot;: &quot;sha256:1a77c0b2...9f31&quot;,&#10;  &quot;target_hash&quot;: &quot;sha256:6c1f9a3e...b7d2&quot;,&#10;  &quot;ops&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;op&quot;: &quot;add_rule&quot;, &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;ID-RESTRICTED-CATEGORY-0142&quot;, &quot;section&quot;: &quot;category_index&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;op&quot;: &quot;update_rule&quot;, &quot;rule_id&quot;: &quot;DE-AD-LAW-CORRECTION-0088&quot;, &quot;changed&quot;: [&quot;action&quot;, &quot;effective_to&quot;] },&#10;    { &quot;op&quot;: &quot;reindex&quot;, &quot;section&quot;: &quot;banned_terms_dfa&quot;, &quot;reason&quot;: &quot;词表变更导致自动机状态表重建，此项不可增量&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"diff_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"D-90412\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"base_snapshot_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90398</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"base_hash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:1a77c0b2...9f31\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"target_hash\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sha256:6c1f9a3e...b7d2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"ops\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"add_rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ID-RESTRICTED-CATEGORY-0142\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"section\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category_index\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"update_rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rule_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DE-AD-LAW-CORRECTION-0088\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"changed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"effective_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"op\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reindex\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"section\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"banned_terms_dfa\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"词表变更导致自动机状态表重建，此项不可增量\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>reindex</code> 必须显式存在，因为它标记的是<strong>不可增量的部分</strong>：词汇自动机的状态转移表在词表变化后几乎总是整体重建，试图增量更新会得到与全量编译不一致的结构，而哈希比对会发现并退回全量拉取。节点先校验 <code>base_hash</code>，不符则直接全量拉取；应用 diff 后重算哈希，与 <code>target_hash</code> 不符则回滚到前一份并全量拉取。这条兜底让增量下发从「需要绝对正确的复杂逻辑」变成「错了就退全量」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"下发通道与灰度\">下发通道与灰度</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>通道</th>\n<th>传播延迟</th>\n<th>一致性保证</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>主要风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推（长连接推送）</td>\n<td>亚秒级</td>\n<td>尽力而为，需对账</td>\n<td>少量核心过滤服务、下架黑名单</td>\n<td>断连期间静默失聪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拉（周期轮询 + 版本头）</td>\n<td>秒到分钟级</td>\n<td>最终一致，可验证</td>\n<td>大规模 serving 节点</td>\n<td>轮询间隔构成延迟下限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置中心 watch</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n<td>已有成熟配置基建的场景</td>\n<td>配置中心自身成为单点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随包发布</td>\n<td>天级</td>\n<td>强一致（同版本）</td>\n<td>过滤逻辑本身变更</td>\n<td>不适用于策略热更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键设计点是<strong>无论用哪种通道，节点都要能自我校验当前生效版本</strong>：节点暴露内部状态端点返回 <code>{snapshot_id, content_hash, effective_from, loaded_at}</code>，由中心侧巡检周期比对全网分布，发现落后超过阈值即告警。这是发现「静默失聪」节点的唯一有效手段——推通道的断连在应用层完全无感。</p>\n<h3 id=\"灰度圈层与自动推进判据\">灰度圈层与自动推进判据</h3><p>策略变更的风险与代码变更同级，因此需要圈层（ring）发布。合理的圈层划分不按机器数量而按<strong>影响面</strong>：内部测试流量 → 单市场小流量 → 单市场全量 → 同法域多市场 → 全球。每圈停留时间必须长到能观察到申诉率与拦截量的变化，因为过滤效果指标（拦截率、申诉率、人工复核确认率）需要小时级窗口才能达到统计显著。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;rollout_id&quot;: &quot;RO-90412&quot;,&#10;  &quot;rings&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;ring&quot;: &quot;internal&quot;, &quot;min_dwell&quot;: &quot;30m&quot;, &quot;guard&quot;: { &quot;max_appeal_rate_delta&quot;: 0.02, &quot;max_block_rate_delta&quot;: 0.3 } },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;ring&quot;: &quot;id-id-canary&quot;,&#10;      &quot;min_dwell&quot;: &quot;2h&quot;,&#10;      &quot;guard&quot;: { &quot;max_appeal_rate_delta&quot;: 0.01, &quot;max_block_rate_delta&quot;: 0.15 }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;ring&quot;: &quot;id-id-full&quot;,&#10;      &quot;min_dwell&quot;: &quot;6h&quot;,&#10;      &quot;guard&quot;: { &quot;max_appeal_rate_delta&quot;: 0.005, &quot;max_block_rate_delta&quot;: 0.1 }&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;auto_advance&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;auto_rollback_on_guard_breach&quot;: true,&#10;  &quot;freeze_windows&quot;: [&quot;regulator_inquiry_open&quot;, &quot;peak_traffic_season&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rollout_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RO-90412\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ring\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"internal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_dwell\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"30m\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"guard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_appeal_rate_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_block_rate_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ring\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"id-id-canary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"min_dwell\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"guard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_appeal_rate_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_block_rate_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ring\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"id-id-full\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"min_dwell\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"6h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"guard\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_appeal_rate_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.005</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_block_rate_delta\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"auto_advance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"auto_rollback_on_guard_breach\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"freeze_windows\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"regulator_inquiry_open\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"peak_traffic_season\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>guard</code> 里的两个阈值是<strong>成对</strong>的：只限制申诉率不限制拦截量，会让「什么都没拦」成为最容易通过的状态；只限制拦截量不限制申诉率，会让误杀悄悄通过。推进判据本身需要防抖，否则会在阈值边界反复切换：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>自动动作</th>\n<th>人工介入点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全部门槛内</td>\n<td>指标变化在预期内</td>\n<td>停留期满后推进</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拦截量超阈</td>\n<td>可能是覆盖增强或误杀</td>\n<td>暂停推进，继续观察</td>\n<td>抽样复核确认率后裁决</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>申诉率超阈</td>\n<td>误杀嫌疑</td>\n<td>立即回滚</td>\n<td>复盘编译校验的缺口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标数据缺失</td>\n<td>埋点或聚合链路故障</td>\n<td>暂停推进</td>\n<td>先修指标再谈推进</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行最常被忽略：把「没有数据」当成「没有异常」是灰度推广里最危险的默认行为，因此判据实现必须把缺失当作不通过。申诉链路的指标定义见 <a href=\"../evidence-appeal-report/false-positive-appeal\">误杀申诉与白名单</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"节点侧的执行语义\">节点侧的执行语义</h2><p>节点加载快照时的核心要求是<strong>原子切换</strong>与<strong>双缓冲</strong>，绝不允许「新策略加载到一半，部分规则已生效」的窗口，因为那个窗口里的判定既不属于旧版本也不属于新版本，事故复盘无法归因。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"LOAD_SNAPSHOT(new):&#10;  1. verify_signature(new.artifact)          -&gt; 失败则 ABORT，保留旧版本&#10;  2. decompile(new.artifact)                 -&gt; 得到索引结构 T_new&#10;  3. validate(T_new.content_hash == new.hash)-&gt; 失败则 ABORT&#10;  4. acquire(write_lock)&#10;  5. standby = T_new&#10;  6. check standby.rule_count == new.rule_count&#10;  7. active &lt;-&gt; standby                      # 指针交换，单条原子指令语义&#10;  8. release(write_lock)&#10;  9. report_loaded(new.snapshot_id, new.hash)&#10;&#10;EVALUATE(request):&#10;  1. T = active                              # 读指针，无锁&#10;  2. hits = T.match(request)&#10;  3. return reduce(hits)                     # 按动作强度聚合\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>LOAD_SNAPSHOT(new):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. verify_signature(new.artifact)          -> 失败则 ABORT，保留旧版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. decompile(new.artifact)                 -> 得到索引结构 T_new</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. validate(T_new.content_hash == new.hash)-> 失败则 ABORT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  4. acquire(write_lock)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  5. standby = T_new</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  6. check standby.rule_count == new.rule_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  7. active &#x3C;-> standby                      # 指针交换，单条原子指令语义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  8. release(write_lock)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  9. report_loaded(new.snapshot_id, new.hash)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>EVALUATE(request):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  1. T = active                              # 读指针，无锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  2. hits = T.match(request)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3. return reduce(hits)                     # 按动作强度聚合</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第 7 步的指针交换是整个设计的核心：它把「加载一个可能很大的策略包」与「切换生效版本」分离开——加载可以花几秒而不影响任何请求，切换是一个指针赋值，正在进行的请求要么读到旧指针要么读到新指针，不存在中间态。第 9 步上报的 <code>loaded_at</code> 让中心侧可以计算<strong>从发布到全网生效的传播时间</strong>，它本身是需要监控的合规指标：若某辖区要求「接到通知后 X 小时内下架」，传播时间 P99 必须显著小于 X。验签失败的节点必须拒绝加载并保持上一版快照并告警，绝不能「验签失败就以未过滤状态启动」——那是把可用性置于合规性之上。</p>\n<h3 id=\"内存与加载成本的权衡\">内存与加载成本的权衡</h3><p>策略快照的内存占用随规则数增长：DFA 规模与词表总量线性相关，倒排表与类目/标签基数线性相关。三种应对各有取舍——<strong>分层加载</strong>（按辖区分片）显著降低单节点占用，代价是跨辖区请求需加载多份；<strong>紧凑编码</strong>（DFA 转移表压缩为双数组或稀疏表示）不改语义但增加实现复杂度；<strong>共享内存</strong>在多进程部署下收益最大，代价是升级时需跨进程协调。判据是：单节点只服务单一辖区时分层加载收益最大且实现最简单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生效时序-巡检与回滚\">生效时序、巡检与回滚</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>典型耗时</th>\n<th>不确定性来源</th>\n<th>可压缩手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编译 + 静态校验</td>\n<td>秒到分钟级</td>\n<td>规则量与校验深度</td>\n<td>增量编译、并行校验</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>签名 + 入库</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>密钥服务可用性</td>\n<td>密钥服务本地代理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首圈层下发</td>\n<td>亚秒到秒级</td>\n<td>通道类型</td>\n<td>推通道 + 长连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点加载与原子切换</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>产物体积、反序列化</td>\n<td>增量下发、分层加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全网传播（N 圈层）</td>\n<td>分钟到小时</td>\n<td>圈层停留时间、轮询间隔</td>\n<td>缩短停留（需指标支撑）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表解释了为什么「圈层停留时间」是传播时间的主要构成：其余阶段都能压到秒级，只有圈层停留受限于<strong>指标统计显著所需的时间窗口</strong>。因此缩短传播时间的正确方向不是优化下发通道而是提高效果指标的灵敏度——合规时效的上限由监控能力而非分发能力决定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"巡检-回滚兼容性与回滚演练\">巡检、回滚兼容性与回滚演练</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>巡检发现</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>告警级别</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>节点落后当前版本</td>\n<td><code>snapshot_id</code> 落后且 <code>last_seen_at</code> 新</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>强制该节点拉取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点静默</td>\n<td><code>last_seen_at</code> 超过阈值未更新</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>隔离节点并排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希不一致</td>\n<td>同 <code>snapshot_id</code> 但 <code>content_hash</code> 不同</td>\n<td>紧急</td>\n<td>视为篡改或编译缺陷</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传播时间超合规时限</td>\n<td><code>loaded_at - effective_from</code> 的 P99</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>缩短圈层停留或巡检周期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三行最严重：它意味着编译产物的确定性被破坏（同一 <code>snapshot_id</code> 产生了两种字节），或者某个节点的产物被替换。无论哪一种，「哈希一致即安全」这个前提都不再成立，必须按紧急级别处理。</p>\n<p>回滚之所以会失败，通常因为回滚目标快照的产物已不兼容当前版本的节点二进制。因此版本仓库必须记录每个快照的<strong>产物格式版本</strong>，回滚前校验兼容性，且这条检查必须在发布流程里做成硬门而不是留给事故现场。兼容性不是「格式版本相等」——新节点通常能读旧格式，旧节点一定读不了新格式，因此判定是偏序而非相等。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>演练结果</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>通过且耗时达标</td>\n<td>回滚路径可用</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兼容性检查失败</td>\n<td>回滚目标与节点二进制不兼容</td>\n<td>修产物格式或重编目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时</td>\n<td>传播链路或加载过程过慢</td>\n<td>排查通道与加载耗时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回滚后覆盖率不足</td>\n<td>目标快照缺某些辖区规则</td>\n<td>禁止把它作为回滚目标</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是最有价值的演练发现：它暴露的是「回滚目标已经因规则演进变得不可用」——回滚到它等于在某个辖区关掉过滤。这类问题只在演练时才会被发现，一旦在真实事故中触发，会造成「止血动作制造新漏放」这种最糟的组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"发布事故的处置\">发布事故的处置</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事故类型</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>止血动作</th>\n<th>后续</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>误杀（过度拦截）</td>\n<td>拦截率与申诉率同时跳升</td>\n<td>回滚到上一 ACTIVE 快照</td>\n<td>复盘编译校验为何未拦住</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏放（拦截不足）</td>\n<td>拦截率下降、抽检发现违规</td>\n<td>回滚并加速发布修正版本</td>\n<td>复盘影子评估的判据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分节点未生效</td>\n<td>全网拦截量正常但某地偏低</td>\n<td>定位落后节点并强制拉取</td>\n<td>复盘巡检阈值与告警链路</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点加载失败</td>\n<td>单节点持续用旧版本</td>\n<td>隔离节点并保留旧版本运行</td>\n<td>复盘验签/反序列化健壮性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生效策略必须表达为不可变、可寻址、带内容哈希的快照；编辑与编译分离，让静态校验（覆盖率、互斥冲突、引用完整性）在发布前运行，并清除编译器的非确定性来源以保住哈希可比对性。</li>\n<li>版本仓库用 <code>parent_hash</code> 表达谱系，使回滚成为「重新激活历史快照」而不是「新增反向规则」。</li>\n<li>增量下发依赖 base 哈希匹配，应用后必须重算哈希比对，不符即退回全量。</li>\n<li>下发通道无论推拉，都必须让节点自报生效版本，由中心巡检发现静默落后的节点；哈希不一致按紧急级别处理。</li>\n<li>节点加载必须验签、双缓冲、原子指针切换，验签失败时保持旧版本而不是降级为不过滤。</li>\n<li>灰度圈层按影响面划分，推进判据是拦截量与申诉率的联合变化，且「指标缺失」必须当作不通过。</li>\n<li>传播时间的上限由监控灵敏度而非分发能力决定；回滚兼容性与回滚演练必须作为发布流程的硬门。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>策略被可靠下发之后，它才能在请求链路上真正拦住内容——闸门的位置选择决定了延迟与召回损失如何分配，见 <a href=\"../serving-filter-gate/recall-result-filter-gate\">召回期与结果期过滤闸门</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"策略版本化与下发","id":"策略版本化与下发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：策略快照是不可变对象","id":"核心概念-策略快照是不可变对象"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么编译要与编辑分离","id":"为什么编译要与编辑分离"},{"level":2,"text":"版本仓库与发布的不可变性","id":"版本仓库与发布的不可变性"},{"level":3,"text":"版本号、签名与增量下发","id":"版本号-签名与增量下发"},{"level":2,"text":"下发通道与灰度","id":"下发通道与灰度"},{"level":3,"text":"灰度圈层与自动推进判据","id":"灰度圈层与自动推进判据"},{"level":2,"text":"节点侧的执行语义","id":"节点侧的执行语义"},{"level":3,"text":"内存与加载成本的权衡","id":"内存与加载成本的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"生效时序、巡检与回滚","id":"生效时序-巡检与回滚"},{"level":3,"text":"巡检、回滚兼容性与回滚演练","id":"巡检-回滚兼容性与回滚演练"},{"level":2,"text":"发布事故的处置","id":"发布事故的处置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"违禁词与受限品类分类法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-content-compliance-filter/compliance-policy-model/banned-term-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"召回期与结果期过滤闸门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-content-compliance-filter/serving-filter-gate/recall-result-filter-gate"}}